# S03: SessionController Core — UAT

**Milestone:** M001
**Written:** 2026-10-10T21:21:11.595Z

# S03: SessionController Core — UAT

## Preconditions
- App builds and installs (assembleDebug passes)
- At least one game registered in GameRegistry
- Device has Android SDK with WebView support

## UAT Type
- UAT mode: artifact-driven

## Checks

### C01: Session transitions unit tested
- **Mode:** artifact
- **Check:** SessionControllerTest has ≥15 tests covering valid transitions, illegal transitions, and identity tracking
- **Evidence:** SessionControllerTest.kt contains 37 @Test annotations covering: open/close lifecycle, requestCapture/requestBackground/requestForeground/requestRestore/requestDegraded/requestRecovery/requestClosing, illegal transitions from every state, navigationEpoch increment, profile identity tracking, bridge validation integration

### C02: Bridge validation rejects all five failure modes
- **Mode:** artifact
- **Check:** BridgeValidatorTest has ≥10 tests covering all rejection modes
- **Evidence:** BridgeValidatorTest.kt contains 25 @Test annotations covering: valid message acceptance, ORIGIN_MISMATCH, EPOCH_STALE, REQUEST_UNCORRELATED, PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE, SCHEMA_UNSUPPORTED, priority ordering (origin checked before epoch)

### C03: PlaySurface observes controller state
- **Mode:** artifact
- **Check:** PlaySurface uses collectAsState on controller.state; no local remember state
- **Evidence:** PlaySurface.kt line 35: `val state = controller.state.collectAsState().value`; menu callbacks route through controller.requestForeground() and controller.requestClosing()

### C04: SessionController created at NavHost scope
- **Mode:** artifact
- **Check:** HubNavigation creates SessionController via remember(lifecycleOwner, registry, dao) — not inside composable remember
- **Evidence:** HubNavigation.kt line 47: `val controller = remember(lifecycleOwner, registry, dao) { SessionController(...) }`

### C05: No regressions in S01/S02 tests
- **Mode:** runtime
- **Check:** Full unit test suite passes
- **Evidence:** `./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest --no-daemon` BUILD SUCCESSFUL; `./gradlew :app:assembleDebug --no-daemon` BUILD SUCCESSFUL

### C06: Stateless bridge validator (JVM-only)
- **Mode:** artifact
- **Check:** BridgeValidator has no Android dependencies; runs on JVM
- **Evidence:** BridgeValidator.kt imports only kotlinx.coroutines and kotlin standard library; no android.* imports

## Edge Cases
- Illegal transition from Playing directly to Closed (rejected)
- Stale epoch message from old session (rejected as EPOCH_STALE)
- Uncorrelated request ID (rejected as REQUEST_UNCORRELATED)
- Oversized payload (rejected as PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE)
- Unknown schema (rejected as SCHEMA_UNSUPPORTED)
- SessionController lifecycle events (ON_PAUSE does not auto-transition)
